            <lb edRef="inst:4652" n="101b2"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex026012026-11-0601-44-07" status="reviewed"><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex026012026-11-0612-20-04" status="unreviewed"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3816">byang yes</rs> na re rten 'brel bsgoms pas zhes nas | de gzung pa med par rtogs la | 'dzin pa med par ma rtogs pa'i rgyu mtshan du sbyar ba la | de phyir rang <expan>bzhin med</expan> par rtogs pa'i rgyur bshad pa la bye brag rgyu mtshan du 'gro lugs mi shes gsung yang | de ni gzung pa stong pa'i rten 'brel tsam bsgoMs pa'i phyir zhes gsung ngo</seg>
