					<l><lb edRef="inst:4652" n="198a1"/> phan blos khyab pas mkhas rnams bzod par mdzod ||</l> 

					<note type="gloss">lnga pa dge ba bsngo ba la 3 las 'gro ba spyi la bsngo ba</note>
					<lg><l>bsod nams 'di yis 'gro ba ma lus pa ||</l> 
					<l>shes par bya ba'i yum ni 3 po rgyu ||</l> 
					<l>sbyor ba 4'i bdag nyid nyaMs su blangs nas ni ||</l> 
					<l>'bras bu chos sku myur du skyed par shog ||</l> </lg>

					<note type="gloss">rang nyid kyi bsngo ba</note> 
					<lg><l><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference">bdag</rs> kyang deng nas byang chub ma reg par || </l>
					<l>dal 'byor rgyud de rab tu byung gyur nas ||</l>
				<l><lb edRef="inst:4652" n="198a2"/> chos kyi dam pa 'di dang mi 'bral zhing || </l>
				<l>'gro ba rnams kyi snang pa byed par shog ||</l></lg> 
				
				<note type="gloss">brtag bcos rgyun ring par smon pa</note>
				<lg><l>rnam bshad 'di yang bstan pa gnas kyi bar ||</l> 
				<l>blo gsal rnams kyis legs par rtogs gyur te ||</l> 
				<l>phyogs dang phyogs 'tshams sa stengs <expan>thams cad</expan> du || </l>
				<l>lha me lhar nge kun du rgyas byed shog ||</l></lg></seg>
		</ab>
        <ab xml:space="preserve" type="colophon"> 
			<seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex026012026-05-0601-47-35" status="reviewed" ana="corpusmd:colophon">
			<milestone unit="section" n="Colophon (198a3-198a4)"/>
         	<lb edRef="inst:4652" n="198a3"/> <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:4653"><rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:3711">shes rab kyi pha rol tu phyin pa'i man ngag gi bstan bcos mngon par rtogs pa rgyan</rs> ces bya ba'i 'grel bshad | 'thad ldan gsal byed rin po che'i snang ba</rs> zhes bya ba <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3924">shag kya'i dge slong rigs par smra zhing brtul shugs la legs par gnas pa shes rab grags</rs> kyis nye bar sbyar ba || rdzogs s+h+yo || </seg>
		</ab>
		<ab>
			<seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex026012026-11-0609-34-18" status="reviewed" ana="corpusmd:colophon">
			<milestone unit="section" n="Post-colophon annotation"/>
            <lb edRef="inst:4652" n="198a4"/> chan gyi yige 'di dag kyang rgya bod kyi brgyud pa'i bla ma rnams kyi shing rta chen po'i srol la gces spras bya ba dang | de dag la ma gus pa dang khyad gsod pa mngas dang | 
			nga (srod rang)? gis ma rig par nga rgyal gyis dregs nas rang dga' dang gzu lums su smra ba spang pa'i phyir dang | 
			bstan pa dang 'gro ba la phan sems kyis brtul zhugs mchog la gnas shing? <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:6525">lung dang rigs pa smra ba'i dge slong rdo rje grags</rs> kyis bkod pa'o ||</seg>
			
			<seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex026012026-11-0609-44-16" status="reviewed"><lb edRef="inst:4652" n="198a5"/> || <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:8622">'jam dpal rtsa ba'i rgyud</rs> las <quote>
         
            <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3786">rngog <choice><corr>lo</corr><orig>la</orig></choice> tsha ba</rs> lung bstan pa ni || 
				<lg>
				<l xml:space="preserve">°sngon <expan>sems can</expan> <expan>thams cad</expan> la ||</l>
				<l>gtang dka'i 'dog ba ma lus btang ||</l> 
				<l>bya dga' mi bzad de yang byas ||</l> 
				<l>de'i phyi ngan pa? sangs rgyas ||</l> 
				<l>'di nas <rs type="place">byang phyogs gangs</rs> 'gram du ||</l> 
				<l>nga'i bstan pa 'dzin brtson pa || </l>
				<l>blo ldan gang dag 'byung 'gyur ba ||</l> 
				<l>de ni shes rab mtha' gnas ming || </l>
				<l>yi ge sgra bshad byas pa las || </l>
				<l>blo gros thogs pa myed pa 'byung </l>
